# my-blog content engine - editorial run (M-5). Times below are LOCAL.
# NOTE: local cron HOUR is wall-clock; the heartbeat Cadence is UTC-framed (hour=9).
#   Reconciled by run_id/calendar-day matching (see heartbeat.check_heartbeat).
# The RUN line carries the deploy env (PIPELINE_GIT_PUSH/_EMBEDDER/_MODEL); to be
# notified of failures, ALSO add at the top of the crontab (owner secrets):
#   ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://...   UPTIME_PING_URL=https://...
# RUN: daily at 09:00 local - drive one editorial slate.
0 9 * * *  cd <REPO_ROOT> && PIPELINE_GIT_PUSH=1 PIPELINE_EMBEDDER=real PIPELINE_MODEL=opus python3 -m pipeline.schedule.cron run    >> <STATE_DIR>/cron.log 2>&1
# MONITOR: daily 18:00 local dead-man's-switch (alert on missed/stalled).
0 18 * * *   cd <REPO_ROOT> && python3 -m pipeline.schedule.cron monitor >> <STATE_DIR>/cron.log 2>&1
